# 📘 C++ Fundamentals (From Zero to Solid OOP)

This repository is a **structured, comment-driven C++ learning journey** designed to guide learners from **basic syntax** to **professional Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)**.

Unlike typical C++ tutorials, this project:
- focuses on **executable `.cpp` files**
- explains **concepts inside source code comments**, not external documents
- follows a **strict learning order** (based on W3Schools C++ tutorial flow)
- avoids skipping fundamentals
- emphasizes **encapsulation, data hiding, and clean C++ design**

> 🎯 **Goal:**  
> Build a rock-solid C++ foundation so advanced topics feel logical, not dangerous.

